<title>JAPAN: Kayaba Industry files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Kayaba Industry files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kayaba Industry Co Ltd said on Monday that it had filed an application to the Ministry of Finance (MOF) for a shelf registration.</p>
<p>The registration will be effective from November 16. It will allow the firm to issue corporate bonds up to 15 billion yen, it said.</p>
</text>
